    "delineation": "Chapter",
    "number": 3,
    "summary": "Joshua leads Israel to the Jordan—The Lord cuts off the water of the Jordan; it stands up as a heap, and Israel passes over on dry ground.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "And Joshua rose early in the morning; and they removed from Shittim, and came to Jordan, he and all the children of Israel, and lodged there before they passed over.",
